{"journal_head_digest":"3dee752fc940b67d5b77121d36e718595a4065e6b2d719e793924d2c701446c1","plan_key":"macro-product-flow","plan_version":"v1","project_id":"OpenLogicool","projection_version":3,"schema":"lattice.todo_snapshot.v3","snapshot_digest":"d97a54522d6a77ccb00fb6a90183e316931e49f9d2cbf80ccee0b4593bc18cd5","tasks":[{"blocked_reason":null,"done_at":"2026-08-25T17:17:40.654Z","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"74a40bafce6a956214afe14d227f9dcec15befb030ade893f8c120ab43cc6288","evidence_id":"ev-macro-product-flow-t01-characterization","git_blob_oid":"f22dd1d8f725fad3eb193c19741ef099dcab694a","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/macro-product-flow/t01-characterization.md","repo_id":"self"},"evidence_unverified":false,"imported":false,"started_at":"2026-08-25T17:17:38.714Z","status":"done","task_id":"t01-characterization","test_result":"# t01 既存UIと通常bindingの不変契約\n\n判定日: 2026-08-26\n\n## 固定する現行構造\n\n- Input Studioは既存の上部bar、左の操作一覧、中央のG13／G600 tab＋device模式図、右の割当Inspector、下部保存領域を維持する。\n- 通常actionは`WorkspaceActionEntry.Outputs`から`WorkspaceCompiler`を通り、device別`MappingProfile`へcompileされる。\n- 物理inputは`DeviceMappingRuntime`で通常output edgeへ変換され、`FastPathPump`から既存emitterへ送られる。\n- Game Operatorは既存`GameOperatorWindow`内のTabControlを維持し、新機能は同じWindowへtab追加する。\n\n## baseline\n\n- Desktop 92件green。\n- Profiles 25件green。\n- Input 151件green。\n- Host 212件green。\n- Playbooks 154件green。\n- 合計634件、失敗0、skip 0。\n\n## 受入\n\nmacro追加後も通常actionのWorkspaceDocument、MappingProfile、mapped output edge、emitter入力を変えない回帰testを保持する。Input Studio全体の再設計、新しいWindow、ViewModel／DI framework移行は行わない。\n\n## 統括記録\n\n多段受入のためorchestrate Control initを試行したが、既存の未追跡probe資産を含むworkspace fingerprintが64MiB上限を超えてfail closedした。資産を削除・ignore化せず、既存Lattice plan `macro-product-flow`と単一親直列を工程正本とする。writer委譲は行わず、終端の契約反証だけ円卓を使う。\n"},{"blocked_reason":null,"done_at":"2026-08-25T17:25:18.093Z","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"22475a50666bc6604582ecb3b8531c8b4eafa48d174adde41d551c883ba052af","evidence_id":"ev-macro-product-flow-t02-macro-domain","git_blob_oid":"db9d7cff6ac0e124cb5d06d691521e927e6c525a","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/macro-product-flow/t02-macro-domain.md","repo_id":"self"},"evidence_unverified":false,"imported":false,"started_at":"2026-08-25T17:18:28.849Z","status":"done","task_id":"t02-macro-domain","test_result":"# t02 macro token・catalog・合成契約\n\n- macro正本は既存Learning Route revisionのまま。新schema／新DBは追加していない。\n- `MacroInvocationTokens`はroute ID、exact versionまたはlatest追従、AI監視modeだけを保持する。\n- latest追従tokenにより、AI修復後のappend-only新版をdevice bindingの再保存なしで実行できる。\n- `MacroRouteComposer`は2件以上のCompiled／Verified sourceを選択順に連結し、同一game／environmentとedge連続性を既存`LearningRouteValidator`で検証する。\n- `HostMacroCatalog`はSQLiteの最新macro一覧、exact/latest解決、合成route appendを既存store上で提供する。\n- source macro revisionは変更しない。\n\n## focused\n\n- `MacroInvocationTokensTests`／`MacroRouteComposerTests`: 10件green。\n- `HostMacroCatalogTests`: 1件green。最新version一覧、合成、source履歴保持、SQLite復元を確認。\n"},{"blocked_reason":null,"done_at":"2026-08-25T17:28:28.075Z","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"6d4fecaf1ba96fb75669bcb0dbe821684027def928e1b3f12231c0e6951a5f4f","evidence_id":"ev-macro-product-flow-t03-playback-modes","git_blob_oid":"98b52e49ba4158b6eb4ee17915480fae3cb82e33","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/macro-product-flow/t03-playback-modes.md","repo_id":"self"},"evidence_unverified":false,"imported":false,"started_at":"2026-08-25T17:25:46.733Z","status":"done","task_id":"t03-playback-modes","test_result":null},{"blocked_reason":null,"done_at":"2026-08-25T17:30:24.086Z","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"8cc45fb9060b97f2709499bc0545e2ef33f8b9fe22b51631669a2cc80c23716f","evidence_id":"ev-macro-product-flow-t04-fastpath-trigger","git_blob_oid":"b10a11904b9e33e2b649185394b29dfcfecb280c","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/macro-product-flow/t04-fastpath-trigger.md","repo_id":"self"},"evidence_unverified":false,"imported":false,"started